Package: qt6-wayland
Version: @DEB_QTWAYLAND_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base, libwayland0, angle
Description: Qt 6 Wayland client platform plugin for the Xios desktop
 The wayland QPA platform plugin plus shell integrations. Qt applications
 started with -platform wayland connect to the iosc compositor. Software
 clients still use wl_shm; accelerated clients use QtWayland EGL through the
 ANGLE/IOSurface shim packaged as /var/jb/lib/angle/libEGL.dylib.
 .
 This is the windowing path for the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios
 desktop.
